---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const effective = 'August 14, 2026';
---
<Base title="Terms of Use — Angel0x1" description="The terms for using Angel0x1, its subscriptions, and the early-access waitlist.">
  <main class="wrap legal">
    <a href="/" class="eyebrow back">← Back</a>
    <p class="soul legal-title">Terms of Use</p>
    <p class="eyebrow faint">Effective {effective}</p>
    <p class="soft lead">
      These terms govern this website, the Angel0x1 waitlist, and the Angel0x1 app
      (“the App”). By joining the waitlist or using the App you agree to them. If you
      don’t agree, please don’t use them.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">1 · Who can use it</h2>
      <p class="soft">Angel0x1 is intended for people 17 or older. By using it you confirm you are.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">2 · What Angel0x1 is</h2>
      <p class="soft">
        A private journaling app whose reflections are generated by AI running on your
        device. It’s a tool for personal reflection — nothing more. It is not a medical
        device and does not provide medical, psychological, legal, or financial advice.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">3 · No account</h2>
      <p class="soft">
        Angel0x1 has no sign-up, no username, and no password. Your identity for
        purchases is your Apple ID, handled entirely by Apple — we never create or hold
        an account for you. Optional referral and early-access rewards use your iCloud
        identity through Apple’s CloudKit; we never receive your name, email, or
        contacts from it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">4 · Subscriptions &amp; free trial</h2>
      <p class="soft">
        Angel0x1 is a paid app, offered as an <strong>auto-renewable subscription</strong>
        (monthly and annual), each starting with a <strong>7-day free trial</strong> for
        eligible new subscribers. Exact prices are shown in the App before you buy and in your
        local currency.
      </p>
      <ul class="soft points">
        <li>If you don’t cancel during the free trial, it converts to a paid subscription automatically.</li>
        <li>Payment is charged to your Apple ID at confirmation of purchase (for a trial, when it ends).</li>
        <li>The subscription renews automatically for the same period and price unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours before the current period ends.</li>
        <li>Your Apple ID is charged for renewal within 24 hours before the period ends.</li>
        <li>Manage or cancel anytime in your device’s Settings → your Apple ID → Subscriptions. Cancelling stops the next renewal; the current period is not refunded except where the law requires.</li>
        <li>You can restore an existing purchase on a new device from the App — it’s tied to your Apple ID, not to any account with us.</li>
        <li>Purchases are processed by Apple under Apple’s terms; refunds are handled by Apple.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">5 · Reserving a spot &amp; free months</h2>
      <p class="soft">
        Reserving a spot is free and places no obligation on you. The first 1,000
        people to reserve a spot before launch are eligible for <strong>3 months of
        Angel0x1 free</strong>.
      </p>
      <ul class="soft points">
        <li>To reserve, you confirm your email address with a one-time code we send to it. This verifies the address is really yours; unconfirmed emails do not hold a spot.</li>
        <li>The 3 free months are redeemed on your Apple ID via a one-time App Store code we send at launch. After the free months, standard subscription pricing applies unless you cancel.</li>
        <li>The reward is personal and non-transferable, granted once per person and once per email, and redeemed on the Apple ID you use at launch.</li>
        <li>Duplicate, automated, or fraudulent signups may be disqualified. We limit reservations per network to keep it fair.</li>
        <li>If circumstances beyond our control make this reward impractical, we may provide a reasonably equivalent benefit instead.</li>
        <li>Your reservation email is used only to reach you about launch and to grant this reward — see the <a href="/privacy" class="ilink">Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <!-- T_MARK -->

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">6 · AI-generated content</h2>
      <p class="soft">
        The feelings the App names, its readings, summaries, prompts, and replies are
        produced by AI and may be inaccurate, incomplete, or simply wrong. They are
        prompts for your own thinking, not facts about you or advice. Don’t rely on them
        for decisions of importance.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">7 · Not professional help · crisis</h2>
      <p class="soft">
        Angel0x1 is not therapy, diagnosis, or an emergency service, and creates no
        professional relationship. If you may be in danger or thinking of harming
        yourself, contact your local emergency number now, or in the US call or text
        <strong>988</strong> (Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline). Please reach for real,
        human help.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">8 · Your data &amp; your responsibility</h2>
      <p class="soft">
        Your entries and the App’s reflections are encrypted and stored only on your
        device. You’re responsible for your own backups and for how you interpret or act
        on the App’s output; deleting the App or using “erase everything” permanently
        destroys your data, and we cannot recover it. Use the App only for your own
        lawful, personal reflection — don’t misuse, reverse-engineer, or interfere with it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">9 · As-is, and limits of liability</h2>
      <p class="soft">
        Angel0x1 is provided “as is” and “as available,” without warranties of any kind
        to the fullest extent permitted by law, including accuracy or uninterrupted
        availability. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Angel0x1 is not
        liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages, or for any action
        taken in reliance on the App or its AI output. Some jurisdictions don’t allow
        certain limitations, so parts of this may not apply to you.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">10 · Pre-release</h2>
      <p class="soft">
        Angel0x1 is under active development. Features and the direction described on
        this site are aspirational and may change.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="h3">11 · Changes, law &amp; contact</h2>
      <p class="soft">
        We may update these terms; material changes will be posted here and, in the App,
        require you to accept again. These terms are governed by applicable law.
        Questions: <a href="mailto:privacy@angel0x1.com" class="ilink">privacy@angel0x1.com</a> (Angel0x1).
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="eyebrow faint updated">This is a plain-language summary, not a substitute for legal advice.</p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: 680px; padding-block: clamp(120px,16vh,180px) 120px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .legal-title { font-size: clamp(40px,7vw,72px); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1; }
  .legal .lead { margin: 10px 0 18px; font-size: 1.05em; }
  .legal section { padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-2); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .legal .h3 { font-size: clamp(19px,2.4vw,24px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .legal .points { margin: 4px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; }
  .legal .points li { line-height: 1.55; }
  .legal .ilink { color: var(--red); }
  .legal .ilink:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .back { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .updated { margin-top: 34px; }
</style>

